; ============================================================================
;  market_action.sqs  -  thin addAction dispatcher for the market / HQ layer.
; ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
;  addAction runs this FILE with _this bound to [target, caller, actionId]
;  (EntityAI::AddUserAction -> Script(desc->script, [this, person, id])).
;
;  It deliberately does NO state mutation: it only ENQUEUES the request so
;  market.sqs's loop remains the single writer of the gmResources debit, the
;  HQ election, the garage locks and the cache stashes. market.sqs polls
;  gmMktReqPending every second and dispatches on gmMktReqId. Same
;  queue-and-consume pattern as recruit_action.sqs / the native-event
;  handlers (see init.sqs).
; ============================================================================

gmMktReqId = _this select 2
gmMktReqCaller = _this select 1
gmMktReqPending = true
exit
